      m_TriggerDelay: 0
      m_CommAudioEvent: Play_Silence_3sec
      m_CommSubtitle: Blue, Green, secure the roof. Check for stragglers. Gray, with me.
  - m_CharacterPortrait: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 50582f1391410734c8eb9f006d673e8f, type: 3}
    m_CharacterName: Tutorial
    m_DialogEvents:
    - m_EventType: 1
      m_TriggerDelay: 0
      m_CommAudioEvent: Play_Silence_3sec
      m_CommSubtitle: Drag your finger across the right side of the screen to look around.
    - m_EventType: 1
      m_TriggerDelay: 3
      m_CommAudioEvent: Play_Silence_3sec
      m_CommSubtitle: Drag your finger on the left side of the screen to move in any direction.
  - m_CharacterPortrait: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 2462f0e20ad7dd54d85a6086e91e0e85, type: 3}
    m_CharacterName: Jaron Namir
    m_DialogEvents:
    - m_EventType: 1
      m_TriggerDelay: 0
      m_CommAudioEvent: Play_Silence_3sec
      m_CommSubtitle: Take cover, I hear someone coming.
  - m_CharacterPortrait: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 50582f1391410734c8eb9f006d673e8f, type: 3}
    m_CharacterName: Tutorial
    m_DialogEvents:
    - m_EventType: 1
      m_TriggerDelay: 0
      m_CommAudioEvent: Play_Silence_3sec
      m_CommSubtitle: Tap on cover objects to enter cover.
  - m_CharacterPortrait: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 37b2dda601540a344937d562e4953c31, type: 3}
    m_CharacterName: Scott Hardesty
    m_DialogEvents:
    - m_EventType: 1
      m_TriggerDelay: 0
      m_CommAudioEvent: Play_Silence_3sec
      m_CommSubtitle: Three targets. Green light?
  - m_CharacterPortrait: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 50582f1391410734c8eb9f006d673e8f, type: 3}
    m_CharacterName: Tutorial
    m_DialogEvents:
    - m_EventType: 1
      m_TriggerDelay: 0
      m_CommAudioEvent: Play_Silence_3sec
      m_CommSubtitle: Tap on an enemy to target him. Then the sniper will take the shot.
  - m_CharacterPortrait: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 37b2dda601540a344937d562e4953c31, type: 3}
    m_CharacterName: Scott Hardesty
    m_DialogEvents:
    - m_EventType: 1
      m_TriggerDelay: 0
      m_CommAudioEvent: Play_Silence_3sec
      m_CommSubtitle: Roof is clear.
  - m_CharacterPortrait: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 50582f1391410734c8eb9f006d673e8f, type: 3}
    m_CharacterName: Tutorial
    m_DialogEvents:
    - m_EventType: 1
      m_TriggerDelay: 0
      m_CommAudioEvent: Play_Silence_3sec
      m_CommSubtitle: You can vault over low cover by tapping the vault button.
  - m_CharacterPortrait: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 2462f0e20ad7dd54d85a6086e91e0e85, type: 3}
    m_CharacterName: Jaron Namir
    m_DialogEvents:
    - m_EventType: 0
      m_TriggerDelay: 0
      m_CommAudioEvent: Play_Silence_3sec
      m_CommSubtitle: This guy's a mob hitter.
    - m_EventType: 1
      m_TriggerDelay: 3
      m_CommAudioEvent: Play_Silence_3sec
      m_CommSubtitle: They all are. Keep up.
  - m_CharacterPortrait: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 9b9708c5ab2b6fe4e85c7d25a3d8cae0, type: 3}
    m_CharacterName: Lawrence Barrett
    m_DialogEvents:
    - m_EventType: 0
      m_TriggerDelay: 0
      m_CommAudioEvent: Play_Silence_3sec
      m_CommSubtitle: Where's... Red?
    - m_EventType: 1
      m_TriggerDelay: 3
      m_CommAudioEvent: Play_Silence_3sec
      m_CommSubtitle: She's around.
  - m_CharacterPortrait: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 2462f0e20ad7dd54d85a6086e91e0e85, type: 3}
    m_CharacterName: Jaron Namir
    m_DialogEvents:
    - m_EventType: 1
      m_TriggerDelay: 0
      m_CommAudioEvent: Play_Silence_3sec
      m_CommSubtitle: Gray, deny their communications.
  - m_CharacterPortrait: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 9b9708c5ab2b6fe4e85c7d25a3d8cae0, type: 3}
    m_CharacterName: Lawrence Barrett
    m_DialogEvents:
    - m_EventType: 0
      m_TriggerDelay: 0
      m_CommAudioEvent: Play_Silence_3sec
      m_CommSubtitle: Done.
    - m_EventType: 1
      m_TriggerDelay: 3
      m_CommAudioEvent: Play_Silence_3sec
      m_CommSubtitle: Target comms are dead. Ready.
  - m_CharacterPortrait: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 2462f0e20ad7dd54d85a6086e91e0e85, type: 3}
    m_CharacterName: Jaron Namir
    m_DialogEvents:
    - m_EventType: 1
      m_TriggerDelay: 0
      m_CommAudioEvent: Play_Silence_3sec
      m_CommSubtitle: Open it.
    - m_EventType: 1
      m_TriggerDelay: 5
      m_CommAudioEvent: Play_Silence_3sec
      m_CommSubtitle: Insertion. Go!
  - m_CharacterPortrait: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 50582f1391410734c8eb9f006d673e8f, type: 3}
    m_CharacterName: Tutorial
    m_DialogEvents:
    - m_EventType: 1
      m_TriggerDelay: 0
      m_CommAudioEvent: Play_Silence_3sec
      m_CommSubtitle: Tap the stance button to toggle your stance. Crouch to enter vents.
  - m_CharacterPortrait: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 50582f1391410734c8eb9f006d673e8f, type: 3}
    m_CharacterName: Tutorial
    m_DialogEvents:
    - m_EventType: 1
      m_TriggerDelay: 0
      m_CommAudioEvent: Play_Silence_3sec
      m_CommSubtitle: You can interact with the world by tapping on highlighted objects.
